{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.rinze.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "路边有人蹲着看木屐",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.rinze.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.rinze.first",
    "idolId": "rinze",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "作为回礼，我会送还的。请告诉我您的所在。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……重新看，真是非常美的孩子啊……怎么说呢，很有气质……）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那个……？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊！抱歉抱歉。手帕不用还，你收下吧。比起那个——要不要试着当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "偶、像……？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我想制作你。我一定会带你走上最好的舞台。……怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "那是莫非……这个凛世，被男子说那样的话，是头一次……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……抱、抱歉。突然这么说，你也为难吧。不过，如果有一点点兴趣，请来名片上的事务所。我等着你。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……此处，是您所在之处……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……必定，会去拜访。这个凛世，不会失礼。那么……"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯……想找适合的孩子，可哪有那么容易。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……哦？那个穿和服的孩子蹲在地上，怎么了？）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你，没事吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……凛世、でしょうか……？木屐的鼻绪，断了……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，断了啊……那个，能借我一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯——我记得在哪本书上读过。把手帕撕开，穿过五元硬币……好，完成了！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "给。……虽然不太好看，但走一小段路没问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "rinze",
        "text": "……您的亲切，感激不尽。可是……您的手帕……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
